{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worldview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fused worldview of sports and fantasy, set in a world where sports are regarded as a faith. Here, the will to compete is transformed into a force to fight against darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104010/extras/14ac71eefdfdbfa980df202dcbb258df.avif?t=1766202846\" width=1560 height=935 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-Protagonist Storyline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as three protagonists from different cities: a teenager who loves playing table tennis, a weightlifter who once earned countless glories but now retires due to injury, and a gymnast. Their fates intertwine under the red moon, with each storyline carrying an independent plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104010/extras/bedab38753ddbb20f0e43d8ce034641d.avif?t=1766202846\" width=1560 height=937 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Quests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore locations including forests, mines, and temples. Collect the game's story content and experience a journey that combines growth and adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay encompasses different categories: work, training, romance, and management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat features both turn-based and action mechanics.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u5df2\u5c01\u5370\u6c34\u6676\u6e2f\u795e\u5e99","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104010/9e1f4e8f7efe1aac7369cea2f9f658675e4b4a5c.jpg"},{"name":"\u5df2\u5c01\u5370\u52b2\u80fd\u